        <obo:IAO_0000115>A 5-methoxy-2-{[(4-methoxy-3,5-dimethylpyridin-2-yl)methyl]sulfinyl}-1&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-benzimidazole that has &lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt; configuration at the sulfur atom. An inhibitor of gastric acid secretion, it is used (generally as its sodium or magnesium salt) for the treatment of gastro-oesophageal reflux disease, dyspepsia, peptic ulcer disease, and Zollinger-Ellison syndrome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
