            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The zwitterion formed from &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-proline by proton transfer from the carboxy group to the ring nitrogen. It is the predominant species at physiological pH.</obo:IAO_0000115>
